  "lines": {
    "49967366": {
      "text": "答案是 B，D 區。D as in Delta 用來確認字母 D。",
      "source_hash": "5cc46c182b77"
    },
    "65054001": {
      "text": "B. 30–40",
      "source_hash": "1ffd635d0a50"
    },
    "80014433": {
      "text": "好的，C 區。我要怎麼走？",
      "source_hash": "4f1bc2adde82"
    },
    "96010276": {
      "text": "B. 左轉",
      "source_hash": "7fbfddf53366"
    },
    "568d1882": {
      "text": "是 B 區還是 C 區？一個字母沒聽清楚，就可能走錯櫃檯。",
      "source_hash": "3e1cbbf10c41"
    },
    "e087532b": {
      "text": "練習詢問報到地點，再聽出區域、櫃檯號碼和方向。",
      "source_hash": "54415179926f"
    },
    "49f30454": {
      "text": "先聽第一段對話，留意雙方需要確認什麼。",
      "source_hash": "352e3421406a"
    },
    "c95cf077": {
      "text": "不好意思，請問 Sunrise Airlines 要在哪裡報到？",
      "source_hash": "10f2c8ce07e5"
    },
    "fa4e27b4": {
      "text": "您可以到 C 區，21到25號櫃檯報到。",
      "source_hash": "3bff22dfa5e6"
    },
    "104beab6": {
      "text": "不好意思，您是說 B 區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "94c2c1716fe5"
    },
    "d02a9d84": {
      "text": "不是，是 C 區，Charlie 的 C。",
      "source_hash": "9353191119f8"
    },
    "17e3fc1e": {
      "text": "好的，C 區。我要怎麼走？",
      "source_hash": "4f1bc2adde82"
    },
    "34ac5b13": {
      "text": "往前直走，然後在服務台左轉。",
      "source_hash": "5401e0ab5668"
    },
    "297d1f6d": {
      "text": "再聽一次，把每個回答和前面的問題連起來。",
      "source_hash": "39c8ae003342"
    },
    "c6c4bcee": {
      "text": "不好意思，請問 Sunrise Airlines 要在哪裡報到？",
      "source_hash": "10f2c8ce07e5"
    },
    "c74fd438": {
      "text": "您可以到 C 區，21到25號櫃檯報到。",
      "source_hash": "3bff22dfa5e6"
    },
    "222f7b48": {
      "text": "不好意思，您是說 B 區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "94c2c1716fe5"
    },
    "8d7b187d": {
      "text": "不是，是 C 區，Charlie 的 C。",
      "source_hash": "9353191119f8"
    },
    "84baf9de": {
      "text": "好的，C 區。我要怎麼走？",
      "source_hash": "4f1bc2adde82"
    },
    "1eacc50b": {
      "text": "往前直走，然後在服務台左轉。",
      "source_hash": "5401e0ab5668"
    },
    "2c5c4e2d": {
      "text": "現在逐段台詞練習。先聽，再開口跟讀。需要更多時間時，請暫停影片。",
      "source_hash": "9ed3ca978b19"
    },
    "da221a71": {
      "text": "不好意思，請問 Sunrise Airlines 要在哪裡報到？",
      "source_hash": "10f2c8ce07e5"
    },
    "7dbd1493": {
      "text": "您可以到 C 區，21到25號櫃檯報到。",
      "source_hash": "3bff22dfa5e6"
    },
    "62cf5bc3": {
      "text": "不好意思，您是說 B 區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "94c2c1716fe5"
    },
    "5daf6f86": {
      "text": "不是，是 C 區，Charlie 的 C。",
      "source_hash": "9353191119f8"
    },
    "22ea87af": {
      "text": "往前直走，然後在服務台左轉。",
      "source_hash": "5401e0ab5668"
    },
    "5865ddad": {
      "text": "換一個情境，不要假設答案相同。請聽出改變了哪些資訊。",
      "source_hash": "17ed4f02eb84"
    },
    "2195e245": {
      "text": "不好意思，這裡是 Maple Airlines 的報到區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "d224a6cb7331"
    },
    "d5701252": {
      "text": "不是。Maple Airlines 在 D 區，Delta 的 D。",
      "source_hash": "1e749ecc07c2"
    },
    "63a5ed41": {
      "text": "我應該到哪幾號櫃檯？",
      "source_hash": "7e6b15e67e12"
    },
    "4fdc9ecf": {
      "text": "30到34號櫃檯。",
      "source_hash": "910bd46130ba"
    },
    "0b39068d": {
      "text": "13號嗎？",
      "source_hash": "1af31aca80dc"
    },
    "5489bec5": {
      "text": "不是，是30號，三、零。",
      "source_hash": "39b184623157"
    },
    "7d738e3b": {
      "text": "我要怎麼走到報到區？",
      "source_hash": "1a83ace576a9"
    },
    "1fdfac7b": {
      "text": "直走經過藥局，再右轉。櫃檯在樓梯旁邊。",
      "source_hash": "c53f48cc5fdd"
    },
    "e311dc4e": {
      "text": "再聽一次，把每個回答和前面的問題連起來。",
      "source_hash": "39c8ae003342"
    },
    "a9257eba": {
      "text": "不好意思，這裡是 Maple Airlines 的報到區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "d224a6cb7331"
    },
    "70b1e15e": {
      "text": "不是。Maple Airlines 在 D 區，Delta 的 D。",
      "source_hash": "1e749ecc07c2"
    },
    "ea777620": {
      "text": "我應該到哪幾號櫃檯？",
      "source_hash": "7e6b15e67e12"
    },
    "d6f05b61": {
      "text": "30到34號櫃檯。",
      "source_hash": "910bd46130ba"
    },
    "b03fb631": {
      "text": "13號嗎？",
      "source_hash": "1af31aca80dc"
    },
    "13e40920": {
      "text": "不是，是30號，三、零。",
      "source_hash": "39b184623157"
    },
    "915d959b": {
      "text": "我要怎麼走到報到區？",
      "source_hash": "1a83ace576a9"
    },
    "76564ed7": {
      "text": "直走經過藥局，再右轉。櫃檯在樓梯旁邊。",
      "source_hash": "c53f48cc5fdd"
    },
    "592ab38e": {
      "text": "和第一段對話比較改變的細節，再開口跟讀。需要更多時間時，請暫停影片。",
      "source_hash": "635e32d7292c"
    },
    "b3360f9c": {
      "text": "不好意思，這裡是 Maple Airlines 的報到區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "d224a6cb7331"
    },
    "8beed743": {
      "text": "不是。Maple Airlines 在 D 區，Delta 的 D。",
      "source_hash": "1e749ecc07c2"
    },
    "da735bbe": {
      "text": "我應該到哪幾號櫃檯？",
      "source_hash": "7e6b15e67e12"
    },
    "c9421ffb": {
      "text": "30到34號櫃檯。",
      "source_hash": "910bd46130ba"
    },
    "aea885b3": {
      "text": "13號嗎？",
      "source_hash": "1af31aca80dc"
    },
    "5212a026": {
      "text": "不是，是30號，三、零。",
      "source_hash": "39b184623157"
    },
    "2e8b0f8e": {
      "text": "我要怎麼走到報到區？",
      "source_hash": "1a83ace576a9"
    },
    "b22ee4b1": {
      "text": "直走經過藥局，再右轉。櫃檯在樓梯旁邊。",
      "source_hash": "c53f48cc5fdd"
    },
    "fc63014d": {
      "text": "接下來有三題聽力測驗。聽相關對話，在解答前選出答案。",
      "source_hash": "93538b29bd11"
    },
    "d8435642": {
      "text": "旅客應該去哪一區？",
      "source_hash": "98adac468c3e"
    },
    "29f6a979": {
      "text": "A. B 區",
      "source_hash": "5c31ddba6fe0"
    },
    "4a3c731c": {
      "text": "B. D 區",
      "source_hash": "6d276505008c"
    },
    "4b7d7794": {
      "text": "C. C 區",
      "source_hash": "049ef02687a6"
    },
    "717b3a05": {
      "text": "不好意思，這裡是 Maple Airlines 的報到區嗎？",
      "source_hash": "d224a6cb7331"
    },
    "63a84dd6": {
      "text": "不是。Maple Airlines 在 D 區，Delta 的 D。",
      "source_hash": "1e749ecc07c2"
    },
    "42785d9d": {
      "text": "現在選出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "1baec593": {
      "text": "請聽出正確的櫃檯號碼。",
      "source_hash": "abca2a4541ae"
    },
    "1248e8bf": {
      "text": "A. 13–16",
      "source_hash": "639e88d6fd24"
    },
    "d0635ad2": {
      "text": "C. 30–34",
      "source_hash": "aec04b02860f"
    },
    "922315fd": {
      "text": "我應該到哪幾號櫃檯？",
      "source_hash": "7e6b15e67e12"
    },
    "a2061c61": {
      "text": "30到34號櫃檯。",
      "source_hash": "910bd46130ba"
    },
    "1818c1b7": {
      "text": "13號嗎？",
      "source_hash": "1af31aca80dc"
    },
    "e4f42566": {
      "text": "不是，是30號，三、零。",
      "source_hash": "39b184623157"
    },
    "9df213aa": {
      "text": "現在選出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "3c424162": {
      "text": "答案是 C，30到34號。服務人員把13更正成30，並補充 three zero。",
      "source_hash": "295e6ed74aec"
    },
    "ffc0061e": {
      "text": "經過藥局以後，要做什麼？",
      "source_hash": "a657c9cbadec"
    },
    "214dd15d": {
      "text": "A. 右轉",
      "source_hash": "2c459a680534"
    },
    "504366dd": {
      "text": "C. 上樓",
      "source_hash": "fd96f19f299e"
    },
    "999ac1e0": {
      "text": "我要怎麼走到報到區？",
      "source_hash": "1a83ace576a9"
    },
    "6ce075f3": {
      "text": "直走經過藥局，再右轉。櫃檯在樓梯旁邊。",
      "source_hash": "c53f48cc5fdd"
    },
    "28c292da": {
      "text": "現在選出你的答案。",
      "source_hash": "a5652ce999fa"
    },
    "92def519": {
      "text": "答案是 A，右轉。next to the stairs 是在樓梯旁邊，不是上樓。",
      "source_hash": "28964adc9cd8"
    },
    "62a7aea6": {
      "text": "最後用自然語速重聽兩段對話。想挑戰自己，可以關掉翻譯字幕，專心聽聲音。",
      "source_hash": "ad5abc8a3fad"
    },
    "ada80047": {
      "text": "不好意思，請問 Sunrise Airlines 要在哪裡報到？",
      "source_hash": "10f2c8ce07e5"
    },
    "f8200a51": {
      "text": "您可以到 C 區，21到25號櫃檯報到。",
      "source_hash": "3bff22dfa5e6"
    },
